1
00:00:00,707 --> 00:00:02,207
(Howard:)What's up?

2
00:00:02,208 --> 00:00:03,878
(Stuart:)Uh, well, I know

3
00:00:03,877 --> 00:00:06,307
(Stuart:)the remodel is coming up,
so I thought I'd make it easy

4
00:00:06,313 --> 00:00:08,583
(Stuart:)on you guys
and find my own place.

5
00:00:08,581 --> 00:00:10,451
Wow. (chuckles)

6
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:13,520
(Howard:)I thought I was done
getting lucky tonight.

7
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,850
(Bernadette:)So, when are you
thinking of moving?

8
00:00:15,855 --> 00:00:17,655
(Stuart:)Uh, actually,
I already found an apartment,

9
00:00:17,657 --> 00:00:19,257
(Stuart:)so in a couple of days.

10
00:00:19,259 --> 00:00:22,459
(Bernadette:)Oh. Okay.

11
00:00:22,462 --> 00:00:25,032
(Bernadette:)Sorry to see you go?

12
00:00:25,031 --> 00:00:28,701
(Amy:)Okay, well,
thank you guys for everything.

13
00:00:28,702 --> 00:00:30,632
I-I really appreciate it.

14
00:00:30,637 --> 00:00:31,767
You're very welcome.

15
00:00:34,641 --> 00:00:35,671
(Sheldon:)Hmm.

16
00:00:35,675 --> 00:00:37,445
(Howard:)What?

17
00:00:37,444 --> 00:00:41,114
(Stuart:)Hmm, I just have never been
in this room while you're awake.

18
00:00:43,616 --> 00:00:45,646
(door closes)

19
00:00:51,591 --> 00:00:53,691
(Sheldon:)What are you doing?

20
00:00:53,693 --> 00:00:57,493
(Raj:)Uh, making sure the telescope's
camera is white-field balanced.

